          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "నిశ్చితార్థం — niścitārthaṁ — \"an engagement (to marry)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "వాళ్ళ నిశ్చితార్థం గత నెల జరిగింది. vāḷḷa niścitārthaṁ gata nela jarigindi. Their engagement took place last month."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "నిశ్చిత, settled, and అర్థం, a matter: the day the match is settled."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "నిశ్చితార్థం (niścitārthaṁ) is borrowed from Sanskrit: niścita, \"ascertained, settled, decided\" (Monier-Williams), and artha, \"a matter, an aim\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
